{"title": "Legendary Action: Vengeful Playmate (Condition)", "pageid": 31529, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Vengeful_Playmate_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Utility Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Legendary Action: Vengeful Playmate</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Once per round when one of Oliver's summoned shadows is destroyed, he can immediately envelop the nearby area in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Wasting_Quiet_(Condition)\" title=\"The Wasting Quiet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Wasting Quiet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Wasting_Quiet_(Condition)\" title=\"The Wasting Quiet (Condition)\">The Wasting Quiet</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowed_Spirit_of_the_Land\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shadowed Spirit of the Land\">Shadowed Spirit of the Land</a> when he has <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Playmate\" title=\"Vengeful Playmate\">Vengeful Playmate</a> available. Expires when used for the round.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Legendary_Action:_Vengeful_Playmate\">Sources of Legendary Action: Vengeful Playmate</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Vengeful_Playmate\" title=\"Legendary Action: Vengeful Playmate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Vengeful Playmate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Vengeful_Playmate\" title=\"Legendary Action: Vengeful Playmate\">Legendary Action: Vengeful Playmate</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203307\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1132/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15927/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6190/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 979321/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.902      1 -total\n 99.05%   41.506      1 Template:Condition_page\n 78.68%   32.968      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 40.99%   17.174      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 22.69%    9.506      1 T